# inc/all: the mathematical standard library, in this order:
#   inc/alg        sorts, operators, elementary and special functions, the
#                  rules (simplification, derivatives D), the rule list All
#   inc/pdiff      partial derivatives
#   inc/numerik    numerics: I, newton, fmin, fmax, ... (numerik,calc)
#   inc/mathnum    numerical values of e and pi, angle units _deg, ...
#   inc/integration/all       exact numbers (inc/exact), the symbolic
#                  helpers (inc/helpers), integration with Integrate
#   inc/integration/rubi/all  the translated Rubi rules (RubiIntegrate)
#   inc/list       lists [a,b] (vector), matrices [[a,b],[c,d]] (matrix)
#   inc/linalg     det, inverse, linsolve, transpose, covectors, symbolic matrices
#   inc/solve      equations: solve(lhs == rhs, x) : Solve
#   inc/simplify   All ends with the normal form
#   inc/help       the help texts for ?name
# Optional, after it: inc/rvector, inc/rmatrix (numerical vectors and
# matrices), inc/eqnsolve (the old equation solver), and the physics:
#   INC "inc/physics"

INC "inc/alg"
INC "inc/pdiff"
INC "inc/numerik"
INC "inc/mathnum"
INC "inc/integration/all"
INC "inc/integration/rubi/all"
INC "inc/list"
INC "inc/linalg"
INC "inc/solve"
INC "inc/simplify"
INC "inc/help"
